    Bug 1911950 - Avoid hang by responding to imap BYE while expecting initial imap greeting. r=mkmelin

    This also causes the full response of a BYE greeting, including any descriptive text included by
    the server, to appear in a pop-up alert. For example:

    The current command did not succeed. The mail server
    for account admin@127.0.0.2 responded:
    * BYE info from server: not interested

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D263310

diff --git a/mailnews/imap/public/nsIImapServerSink.idl b/mailnews/imap/public/nsIImapServerSink.idl
